одов от комиссий остается в экосистеме L2.", "span": [0, 175]}, {"id": "telegram:21:21126#s2", "kind": "event", "actor": null, "action": "summary of events", "object": "Ethereum events on 2026-09-19", "qualifiers": {"event_date": "2026-09-19"}, "origin": "own", "source_role": "editorial", "verification_status": "unverified", "quote": "Что случилось (19.09.2026, Ethereum):", "span": [0, 35]}, {"id": "telegram:21:21126#s3", "kind": "event", "actor": "attacker (EOA wallet)", "action": "withdrew and consolidated funds", "object": "Fetch.ai TokenConversionManagerV3", "qualifiers": {"version": "~8.7 million FET (~$1.53 million)", "event_date": "2026-09-19", "counterparty": "PeckShield"}, "origin": "own", "source_role": "editorial", "verification_status": "source_statement", "quote": "Один и тот же атакующий (EOA-кошелёк) вывел ~8.7 млн FET (~$1.53 млн) из конвертера Fetch.ai TokenConversionManagerV3", "span": [0, 130]}, {"id": "telegram:11:96833#s0", "kind": "event", "actor": "hacker", "action": "hacked and issued tokens", "object": "Singularity NET", "qualifiers": {"version": "260 million AGIX and 53.838 million WMTx on Ethereum", "event_date": "2026-09-20"}, "origin": "own", "source_role": "editorial", "verification_status": "unverified", "quote": "Хакер, взломавший Fetch и Nunet, также взломал Singularity NET, что привело к несанкционированному выпуску 260 млн #AGIX и 53,838 млн #WMTx на Ethereum.", "span": [0, 155]}, {"id": "telegram:21:21127#s2", "kind": "promo_service", "actor": null, "action": "displays funding rates", "object": "ETH funding rates on Binance and Bybit", "qualifiers": {"version": "Binance: +0.0028%, Bybit: +0.0044%"}, "origin": "own", "source_role": "editorial", "verification_status": "unverified", "quote": "ETH: Binance: +0.0028% 🐂 | Bybit: +0.0044% 🐂", "span": [0, 50]}, {"id": "telegram:15:423399#s1", "kind": "event", "actor": "community", "action": "collected ETH and donated Citizens", "object": "Citizens NFT game", "qualifiers": {"version": "69 